With 40 tasks, variable durations and a 4% failure rate per task, some task runs long or fails every night.

348
00:19:28.379 --> 00:19:32.454
A DAG scheduler (Airflow, Argo Workflows, Temporal, Dagster):

349
00:19:32.734 --> 00:19:36.553
It starts a task when its inputs succeeded, and retries with backoff.

350
00:19:36.833 --> 00:19:38.262
