354
00:19:53.508 --> 00:20:02.724
Data-aware triggers: start a task when its input partition lands (a file, a table partition), not just when the upstream task reports success.

355
00:20:03.004 --> 00:20:11.644
Durable execution (Temporal, AWS Step Functions): long-running workflows with timers and retries persisted by the engine.

356
00:20:11.924 --> 00:20:16.084
It is useful for sagas (Ch 46) as well as for batch.

