428
00:23:43.702 --> 00:23:46.027
Design a distributed job scheduler.

429
00:23:46.307 --> 00:23:52.281
Clarify the job types (recurring, delayed, workflows), volumes, timeliness and semantics.

430
00:23:52.561 --> 00:24:00.027
Then: the storage model and firing mechanism;. leases and fencing;. idempotency;. retries and dead letters;.

431
00:24:00.307 --> 00:24:01.971
