703
00:44:59.633 --> 00:45:01.340
Anti-Patterns and Pitfalls.

704
00:45:02.590 --> 00:45:03.507
Watch out:

705
00:45:03.787 --> 00:45:06.091
1. @Scheduled on every replica.

706
00:45:06.371 --> 00:45:08.398
