875
00:56:01.889 --> 00:56:03.403
Which failure disappears?

876
00:56:03.683 --> 00:56:09.635
(B3) In L2, partition the job table by due second and delete by dropping partitions.

877
00:56:09.915 --> 00:56:11.259
Compare claim times.

878
00:56:11.539 --> 00:56:15.529
(B3) In L3, give heavy nights 8 slots instead of 6.

879
00:56:15.809 --> 00:56:18.881
How many 06:00 misses remain?

880
